<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Green's Foods half yr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Green's Foods half yr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 2.17 vs 0.50</p>
<p>    Net profit			 1.07 vs 0.28</p>
<p>    Sales			     73.81 vs 63.95</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	 0.5  vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Green's Foods Ltd is a producer and distributor of cooking ingredients, mixes, pet foods and dressings.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
